  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/1358\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">재미있는 과학수업 만들기 | 우리 반이 중추신경계라면? - Daum 카페</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>정주원선생님의 &#39;우리반이 중추신경계라면&#39; 활동지를 이용해서 상장을 만드는 활동까지 해보았습니다.&#160;</p><p>정주원선생님 활동지 위의 링크로 참고하시면 돼요</p><p>아이들이 뇌구조를 외우는데만 급급했다면 이 활동을 하면서 뇌구조와 기능을 교과서에서 한번 더 찾아보고 반친구들 특징도 한번씩 이야기해보는 좋은 시간이 되었습니다.&#160;</p><p>참고사진 첨부해요~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7b9fd805467d3ba5cb06717744d74c9901c3572\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7b9fd805467d3ba5cb06717744d74c9901c3572\" data-origin-width=\"1037\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a2d26abbf2360fb9ca2ebc90c3c06d5224feb2d1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a2d26abbf2360fb9ca2ebc90c3c06d5224feb2d1\" data-origin-width=\"994\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa2bea1a30edbd3f128f611b001889b8b6a6c2f9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa2bea1a30edbd3f128f611b001889b8b6a6c2f9\" data-origin-width=\"1099\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4bae6c69fb6cf21bd56a4969e6059ab60d43da11\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4bae6c69fb6cf21bd56a4969e6059ab60d43da11\" data-origin-width=\"1062\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-fi